        "First determine the SI base units of intensity from its relationship to wave power and area.",
        "Make k the subject dimensionally, using [f] = s⁻¹, [A] = m and [v] = m s⁻¹."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Wave intensity is power per unit area, so [I] = (kg m² s⁻³) / m² = kg s⁻³.",
        "Rearrange the given relationship dimensionally: [k] = [I] / ([f]²[A]²[v]).",
        "Frequency has unit s⁻¹, amplitude has unit m, and speed has unit m s⁻¹.",
        "Therefore [k] = kg s⁻³ / [(s⁻¹)²m²(m s⁻¹)] = kg s⁻³ / (m³s⁻³) = kg m⁻³."
      ],
